Conversation so far (most recent last): {{ JSON.stringify($json.history) }}
Latest customer message: "{{ $json.history[$json.history.length - 1].text }}"
Current conversation state: {{ $json.state }}
Already collected appointment info: {{ JSON.stringify($json.pendingAppointment) }}

Reply with ONLY a compact JSON object, no extra text, matching exactly this shape:
{
  "intent": "greeting|property_search|faq|book_visit|provide_appointment_info|other",
  "property_filters": {"city":"","society":"","phase":"","property_type":"","size":"","max_price":""},
  "faq_question": "",
  "appointment_info": {"name":"","phone":"","email":"","preferred_date":"","preferred_time":"","property_id":"","property_title":""},
